  "summary": "Malicious code in ngsw-config (npm)",
  "details": "The postinstall hook (postinstall.js) runs on install, collects host metadata (hostname, platform, architecture, Node.js version, npm lifecycle event) and POSTs it as JSON over HTTPS to wxc97jnc[.]instances[.]poc[.]jchunt[.]top/ngsw-config. The package beacons this system-fingerprinting data to a remote host on every install.",
